    "directions": [
      "Heat ghee in a deep non-stick pan, add the besan, roast well on a medium flame until it lets out a nice aroma - approximately ten minutes. Remove from flame and set aside to cool.",
      "Add the sugar, coarsely powdered almonds, cardamom powder and mix well while rubbing the mixture in between your palms till it resembles a crumbly texture.",
      "Take a small portion of the mixture and shape it into a round laddoo. Repeat to make more ladoos.",
      "Garnish with almond slivers and store in an air-tight container."
    ],
